[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":25,"col":13},"end":{"line":25,"col":33}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: every message of the program writes the whole model\nwith `{ next | count = 0 }`, a record of a type the compiler cannot read, so the\ncompiler cannot tell which of the model's fields change\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 4). Write each change in\n`update` itself — a message per change, each writing its fields — and the\nbindings it reaches follow. The program is valid: it builds with\n`--platform=browser-tea`."}]
